Architecture Flow & Services:We need API Gateway $\to$ Amazon EventBridge (Custom Bus) $\to$ Amazon Data Firehose $\to$ Amazon S3, backed by an Amazon SQS Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ) to intercept undelivered events if downstream routing fails.Required IAM Access & Permissions:API Gateway Role: events:PutEvents permission to publish incoming payloads to the EventBridge bus.EventBridge Rule Role: firehose:PutRecordBatch to push records to Firehose, plus sqs:SendMessage to write failed events into the SQS DLQ.Firehose Role: s3:PutObject (and multipart actions) to write files to both the S3 landing path and the S3 error output prefix.  
